# Shelfmark — Library Management System

React frontend + Node/Express API + PostgreSQL (PGlite locally).

## Run

### Backend
```bash
cd backend
npm install
npm run dev
```
API: `http://localhost:5000/api`

### Frontend
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```
App: `http://localhost:5173`

### Seed logins
| Role   | Email                   | Password  |
|--------|-------------------------|-----------|
| Member | priya@shelfmark.local   | member123 |
| Admin  | admin@shelfmark.local   | admin123  |

## Database

- Default: embedded **PGlite** (Postgres-compatible) in `backend/data/`
- Optional real Postgres: set `DATABASE_URL` in `backend/.env`

Schema: `database/schema.sql` · API docs: `docs/API.md` · Workflow: `docs/WORKFLOW.md`

## API base

`http://localhost:5000/api`

Auth · Users · Books · Borrows · Stats — see `docs/API.md`
